  "reason": "The only completed experiment is a simple RNA-only single-profile PCA model with moderate performance, so there is no evidence yet about whether image features are useful. The key uncertainty is whether the image modality provides signal at all before investing in more complex multimodal fusion. config_010 tests a simple image-only ResNet-50 single-profile model, matching the profile complexity of the RNA baseline and avoiding confounds from aggregation or fusion. This establishes an image unimodal baseline, clarifies whether image features are worth pursuing, and gives a reference for later multimodal comparisons, making it a high-information use of the next limited experiment."
}

